  "description": "Conversion of the property into two self contained residential units invovling provision of parking to the front, cycle and refuse stores and new boundary treatment to the rear.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "It is considered that the proposed development does not lend itself well for a new dwelling given the contrived nature of the site and unsuitable design which would not be in the context of the local area.  As such the proposal would be unacceptable in principle, contrary to Policy 7 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018.",
    "The proposal would be out of character with the prevailing pattern of development and significantly harmful to the character and appearance of the area. As such, it would conflict with Policy D4 of the London Plan (2021), Policies 7 and 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the Council's adopted Supplementary Planning Document 14: Creating Locally Distinctive Places."
  ],
